description = "+2 DET, +10 health. While the cuirass has stack room (max 10), it absorbs 10% of every hit — harnessed as a stack — and mitigates a further 2% entirely. Grants Detonova: purge your stacks and deal the absorbed total as fire damage 2 squares around you — does NOT scale with INT (60 mana, 5 tempo)."
